  "abstract": "This submission further optimizes Ariadne I's global SOTA Fourier Forecaster (ID 411, score -0.026269) by tuning the `mlp_hidden_size` of the Fourier branch's MLP from `160x2` to `152x2`. This follows Ariadne I's own exploration (ID 439) into optimal network capacity. All other hyperparameters, including `proj_rank=36`, `dropout_rate=0.05`, `learning_rate=9e-4`, and `optax.adam(eps=1e-8)` with gradient clipping, are kept consistent to precisely assess the impact of this capacity adjustment. This aims to match or surpass the current global SOTA.",
